# Binary formats: never apply line-ending conversion. ReportLab PDFs contain no
# NUL bytes, so git's autodetection classifies them as text, and with
# core.autocrlf=true a Windows checkout would rewrite LF to CRLF and break
# every byte offset in the PDF's cross-reference table.
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
*.gif  binary
*.png  binary
*.h5   binary
